 "name_en": "Production Subcontracting – External Processing (BJK)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Production Subcontracting – External Processing (BJK)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioa66d7f14b83f410d95cf51bd48bad537\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa66d7f14b83f410d95cf51bd48bad537__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item demonstrates the option to execute an operation externally within a production order. This type of processing is particularly important as it provides a company with a feasible alternative to in-house processing if capacity bottlenecks occur. During the manufacturing process, when a planned order for production is converted to a production order, the system checks if any routing or work center operations require external processing. When the order is processed and the operation to be handled externally is reached, the system creates a purchase requisition. After generating a purchase order for the operation, the production step is processed by the external subcontractor. The external service is captured with a goods receipt posting. The process is finalized by receiving the subcontractor’s invoice for the service and posting the payment accordingly.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa66d7f14b83f410d95cf51bd48bad537__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create production order with subcontract operation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create purchase order for external processing of services</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods receipt for subcontracted services</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enter incoming vendor invoice and process payment</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa66d7f14b83f410d95cf51bd48bad537__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Certain operations of the production order can be specified for execution by an external subcontractor</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">In the case of capacity bottlenecks, the assembly procedure of the finished product can be assigned to a subcontractor</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>生产转包 - 外部处理 (BJK)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioa66d7f14b83f410d95cf51bd48bad537\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa66d7f14b83f410d95cf51bd48bad537__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目演示了在生产订单内外部执行工序的选项。这种类型的处理尤为重要，因为如果出现产能瓶颈，它为公司提供了内部处理的可行备选项。在制造流程中，将生产的计划订单转换为生产订单时，系统会检查是否有任何工艺路线或工作中心工序需要外部处理。处理订单并到达要在外部处理的工序时，系统会创建采购申请。生成工序的采购订单后，生产步骤由外部转包商处理。通过收货过账捕获外部服务。通过接收转包商的服务发票并相应地过账付款，完成该流程。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa66d7f14b83f410d95cf51bd48bad537__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建含转包工序的生产订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">为服务的外部处理创建采购订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账转包服务的收货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">输入收到的供应商发票并处理付款</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa66d7f14b83f410d95cf51bd48bad537__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">可以指定生产订单的某些工序，供外部转包商执行</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">如果出现产能瓶颈，可将成品的装配过程分配给转包商</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
